{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4J9Z0QA7X4VQ93DJRGGF2C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日発売の、アップトゥボーイ vol.338"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"表紙巻頭を務めさせていただきました💞\n中面にはかほりんとりなちゃんが登場しております！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"単独では初の表紙撮影でした！！！\nそして髪の毛を短くしての表紙も初でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"復帰後久しぶりのグラビア撮影はなんだかドキドキ、ちょっぴり緊張していたのですがスタッフさんがとても優しくて温かくて段々とリラックスしながら挑むことができました！😭ありがとうございます🥰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4J9ZZXAEWWSZ4C921C778Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n部屋着でまったり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA104RHHK90TWWBW9XR2Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">うーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA20K9Z055QZNH7996SJV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">にこにこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA30Z272498SMX2P1E90R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">この日の撮影で大人っぽい瞬間も少し子供っぽい瞬間もどちらの表情があって良いねと言っていただけて嬉しかったです😆\n私は今、大人と子供間なのかもしれない〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA405DDWGQ566KFXTJET0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこの日はとても天気が良かった☀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA4ZH01AMS8SN3BM44CWB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">いっぱいニコニコ笑いました\n名字の話とかしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA5Z383VYH442GN6JN46H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">謎な壁掛け"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA6YDER6FJ788CWV9991Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">葛西臨海公園にいきました\n雲ひとつない☁️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA83CB8VASHBH9PVMFZQP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n水色とピンク🩷キュンを思い出しますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JA93N8A0A99X81MXRC8GN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">全身はこんな感じ✨可愛い衣装を着ることができて嬉しいです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JAA446WCCG62K4SKPA8NW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">エモ写真"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JAB8SDRQ1NKF0R13XYPRV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">ミラーボール🪩を使って撮影も"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JAC9Z5F8ABV10SAW7B2N9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">😆"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ4JADC955B7MMG0CREZ6W00","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">お誕生日ケーキもいただきました🎂ありがとうございます😭嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーと一緒に何度か表紙を務めさせていただいたことがあったのですが、単独では初めてで本当に嬉しかったです！！！！\nありがとうございます😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インタビューも休養中のお話や近況など色々とお話しさせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非ゲットしてくださると嬉しいです！\n宜しくお願いします🙇‍♀️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでいただきありがとうございました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#662"}],"source":"archive"}